'''Ant's Cave''' is a [[Location]] found in the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}. It can be accessed from the {{Zone|Spring Depths}} in the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}.

{{ZoneText|Break &eAnthills &fand vacuum up &eAnts&f!|Purchase &6Minion Upgrade Stones &ffrom &2Ant&f.|Keep an eye out for the elusive &dQueen Ant&f!}}
== Features ==
'''Ant's Cave''' contains {{MobSprite|Ant}}s and {{MobSprite|Queen Ant}}s, which spawn naturally or from {{Item|Pointed Dripstone|text=Anthills|link=}}. {{MobSprite|Ant}}s and {{MobSprite|Queen Ant}}s can only be damaged and killed by a [[Vacuum]], as they are a {{MobType|Pest}}.

Anthills have {{Stat|BP|6}} and a [[Block Strength]] of {{Green|3,500}}. Breaking one spawns {{Green|2}}-{{Green|4}} {{MobSprite|Ant}}s or {{MobSprite|Queen Ant}}s. It is not affected by {{stat|Mining Spread}}. 

{{Tick Thresholds/Miscellaneous}}

Additionally, the following message is displayed in chat:
{{Dialogue|&7&oYou destroyed an anthill and angered its residents!}}
=== [[Ant (NPC)|Ant]] ===
{{Main|Ant (NPC)}}
Players can also speak to {{NPCSprite|Ant (NPC);Ant}}, who sells Tier XII [[Foraging]] [[Minion]] Upgrade Stones.

